(.25,.55,.35),([-.85,.98],[0,1],[0,.98]),('Scarce resources and trade qualify any strong technical support floor.','Human-derived resident/market agency is central with unequal ownership possible.','Thought-work and technical/caring activity count; personality storage is not leisure.'),
